dicted, so they\u2019re scheming"}, {"n": "34", "text": "The high is calling"}, {"n": "35", "text": "The high is calling"}, {"n": "36", "text": "Music is a drug, there\u2019s no MF?"}, {"n": "37", "text": "Then the sky is falling"}, {"n": "38", "text": "Cook it up, got the block hot, flooded"}, {"n": "39", "text": "With ready rock, they\u2019re fiending"}, {"n": "40", "text": "Doing anything for me"}, {"n": "41", "text": "Addicted, so they\u2019re scheming"}, {"n": "42", "text": "The high is calling"}, {"n": "43", "text": "The high is calling"}, {"n": "44", "text": "Music is a drug, there\u2019s no MF?"}, {"n": "45", "text": "Then the sky is falling"}]}]}